# A visible immortal shuts the game down. Smokegod (60) and Decimus (10) are in the temple (3001). The echo goes to
# everyone, marked "global> " for Smokegod, and ends in a blank line: shutdown adds "\n\r" to the line before echo
# adds its own. Every connection closes, and shutdown.txt says who.
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
shutdown
@file shutdown.txt
